  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (這支流程的功能非常單純：在SAP畫面的交易碼輸入欄裡打入指定的交易碼(Transaction Code)，然後按下Enter鍵執行，等於是自動化執行「手動輸入T-Code再按Enter切換畫面」的動作。)&#xA;Execute SAP transaction code.&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_Selector as Input Selector&lt;String&gt; &#xA;in_TransactionCode as SAP Transaction Code&lt;String&gt; " DisplayName="SRC_SetTransactionCode" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="939,1504" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
    <Sequence.Variables>
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Default="SRC_SetTransactionCode" Name="WorkflowName" />
    </Sequence.Variables>
    <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
      <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
        <x:Boolean x:Key="IsExpanded">True</x:Boolean>
        <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
      </scg:Dictionary>
    </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    <ui:Comment sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,128" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_1" Text=" 這支流程沒有輸出參數(OutArgument)，因為它單純是執行「輸入+送出」的動作，不需要回傳任何資料。" />
    <ui:Comment sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,245" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_4" Text="這支流程就是把「輸入交易碼 → 按Enter執行」這個SAP最基本的操作動作包裝成一個可重複呼叫的元件：只要給它輸入欄的Selector(in_Selector)和想要執行的交易碼(in_TransactionCode)，它就會自動打字並送出Enter，完成畫面切換。整體邏輯只有兩個核心動作(TypeInto + SendHotkey)，沒有任何判斷分支或迴圈，是這系列工具中最精簡的一支。" />
    <ui:LogMessage DisplayName="Log message - Start" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,57" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="LogMessage_1" Level="Info" Message="[WorkflowName + &quot;  start&quot;]">
      <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
        <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
